type: software
title: "tacular: Proteomics ontology and reference-data lookups in Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for looking up common mass-spectrometry proteomics values,
  including protein modifications, elements, fragment-ion types, neutral
  deltas, proteases, and reference molecules.
